WEBVTT

00:04.700 --> 00:10.310
Yay! Yay! Yay!

00:10.310 --> 00:12.730
Hello, boys and girls!

00:12.730 --> 00:17.330
<i>Iruma-kun</i> is about to begin!

00:17.330 --> 00:20.500
Wasn't the Harvest Festival just amazing?

00:21.690 --> 00:25.210
...raise both of your ranks to Dalet.

00:31.160 --> 00:32.390
We're Dalet!

00:34.310 --> 00:39.800
Grandpa is so proud that 
Iruma-kun became the Young King!

00:40.210 --> 00:43.310
The ultimate grandson! 
The ultimate student!

00:43.310 --> 00:46.680
The other kids were amazing, too!

00:46.970 --> 00:50.860
And, and, and then this week, 
Iruma-kun will be...

00:50.860 --> 00:52.320
Would you believe it?

00:52.320 --> 00:55.510
Please watch and find out for yourselves.

00:52.320 --> 00:55.510
Super-duper amazing and kind and cute and...

00:55.510 --> 00:57.940
Iruma-kun!

00:59.550 --> 01:03.200
<i>The students of the Misfit Class 
were given a task.</i>

01:03.500 --> 01:08.580
<i>If they do not all advance to the 
Dalet rank before their second year,</i>

01:08.580 --> 01:13.840
<i>they will be kicked out of the Royal One, 
which they worked so hard to acquire.</i>

01:14.240 --> 01:16.210
<i>Due to their work during 
the Harvest Festival,</i>

01:16.210 --> 01:19.450
<i>Iruma and Lead, happily, 
were promoted to Dalet.</i>

01:19.450 --> 01:22.970
<i>Will the rest of their 
classmates be able to reach Dalet</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:26.670
<i>before their limited days 
as first-years are over?</i>

02:58.030 --> 02:59.800
"Bad Company."

02:58.030 --> 03:02.530
<b>Bad Company</b>

03:03.240 --> 03:05.000
What?!

03:05.800 --> 03:08.620
There's... something you want?

03:10.340 --> 03:11.550
Grandpa?!

03:21.560 --> 03:24.850
Iruma-kun is asking me for 
something for the first time!

03:24.850 --> 03:26.490
We must celebrate, then.

03:26.490 --> 03:29.150
So, what do you want?

03:29.150 --> 03:31.930
Well... Well, you see...

03:43.460 --> 03:44.790
Be right there!

03:45.820 --> 03:48.700
Hey! You're here, Iruma-kun!

03:49.000 --> 03:51.160
And? And?! How'd it go?!

03:51.670 --> 03:53.710
Well...

03:55.460 --> 03:57.580
It's all mine!

04:00.080 --> 04:02.740
He actually bought it for you! Hell yeah!

04:02.740 --> 04:04.720
Yeah! Grandpa bought it for me!

04:07.500 --> 04:10.950
We'd like 666 handheld gaming consoles.

04:10.950 --> 04:12.720
666?!

04:12.720 --> 04:13.360
Yes.

04:13.360 --> 04:15.680
I just need one! One is fine!

04:15.680 --> 04:17.270
You're so spoiled...

04:17.270 --> 04:20.800
Okay! Let's get playing! Come on in!

04:20.800 --> 04:23.200
Th-Thanks for having me over.

04:26.920 --> 04:28.490
You want some Screamy Soda?

04:28.490 --> 04:29.150
Sure!

04:29.150 --> 04:30.240
What about snacks?

04:30.240 --> 04:31.120
Anything's fine.

04:31.120 --> 04:32.530
This should work.

04:32.530 --> 04:34.260
Walk by here quietly...

04:34.260 --> 04:36.000
Don't make a sound.

04:36.000 --> 04:37.400
O-Okay...

04:38.160 --> 04:39.920
And we're here!

04:40.350 --> 04:42.040
Have a seat anywhere you want.

04:44.400 --> 04:47.330
Wow! You have so many things.

04:53.000 --> 04:57.070
Iruma-kun's in my room. It's so weird.

04:57.070 --> 04:58.810
But anyway...

05:01.950 --> 05:03.650
Once again...

05:04.070 --> 05:08.180
We're Young Kings! Cheers! Yay!

05:10.330 --> 05:11.350
That hits the spot!

05:11.350 --> 05:14.080
Painful and refreshing!

05:16.410 --> 05:19.330
So, this is the newest hunting game

05:19.330 --> 05:22.440
where you can make your own 
gear to fight strong monsters,

05:22.440 --> 05:24.980
raise and harvest all kinds of crops,

05:24.980 --> 05:27.410
or make your village grow.

05:27.410 --> 05:30.240
Wow... That sounds like 
the Harvest Festival.

05:30.840 --> 05:33.620
Yeah! And then you push this...

05:34.680 --> 05:35.850
Oh, it started.

05:35.850 --> 05:42.360
<b>Name</b>

05:35.850 --> 05:42.360
<b>m 0 0 l 130 0 130 30 0 30</b>

05:35.850 --> 05:42.360
<b>m 0 0 l 130 0 130 80 0 80</b>

05:35.850 --> 05:42.360
<b>Gender</b>

05:35.850 --> 05:42.360
Male   Female   Other

05:35.850 --> 05:42.360
<b>First-Person Pronoun (I)</b>

05:35.850 --> 05:42.360
Boku   Ore

Watashi   Other

05:36.150 --> 05:38.530
Name... "Iruma."

05:36.350 --> 05:42.360
<b>Iruma</b>

05:38.530 --> 05:42.360
Male... and first-person pronoun is...

05:42.720 --> 05:43.680
Boku (I).

05:43.120 --> 05:44.480
Now, hang on.

05:44.920 --> 05:47.880
I don't know. You should probably...

05:51.440 --> 05:53.120
Go for "ore (I)."

05:55.120 --> 05:57.350
Y-You think I should?

05:57.350 --> 05:58.100
Hell yeah!

05:58.100 --> 06:00.140
We're the Young Kings! 
We can sound more powerful!

06:01.130 --> 06:06.330
Honestly, isn't it pretty hard to figure out 
when the right time to switch to "ore" is?

06:06.330 --> 06:08.800
Yeah, totally.

06:08.800 --> 06:11.120
We're basically the only two 
who still use "boku."

06:11.140 --> 06:12.890
<b>Watashi (I)</b>

06:12.890 --> 06:14.640
<b>Ore (I)</b>

06:14.640 --> 06:16.390
<b>Watakushi (I)</b>

06:16.390 --> 06:18.140
<b>Sessha (I)</b>

06:18.140 --> 06:19.900
<b>Unu (I)</b>

06:19.900 --> 06:23.560
Oh, right. I guess we're boku brethren.

06:23.560 --> 06:25.240
You should just go for it now.

06:26.280 --> 06:27.520
Okay.

06:27.530 --> 06:31.280
<b>First-Person Pronoun (I)</b>

06:27.530 --> 06:31.280
<b>Boku</b>

06:27.530 --> 06:31.280
<b>Ore</b>

06:27.530 --> 06:31.280
<b>Other</b>

06:27.530 --> 06:31.280
<b>Watashi</b>

06:27.990 --> 06:29.810
I-I'll go with "ore."

06:32.910 --> 06:34.950
Next, you choose your partner.

06:35.910 --> 06:37.040
A Neko...

06:35.910 --> 06:41.170
<b>Put your life in the hands of...</b>

06:35.910 --> 06:41.170
m 0 0 l 280 0 280 50 0 50

06:37.740 --> 06:39.270
A demon rabbit...

06:41.170 --> 06:43.000
<b>Neko</b>

06:41.170 --> 06:43.200
I guess I'll go with a Neko.

06:43.200 --> 06:45.160
It seems really reliable, somehow.

06:45.160 --> 06:48.890
I always choose a dragon 
because they're devi strong.

06:48.890 --> 06:50.040
By the way...

06:50.460 --> 06:54.260
You can even get married in this game.

06:54.260 --> 06:57.030
Wow, it lets you do all sorts of things.

06:57.030 --> 06:58.400
Right?

06:58.400 --> 07:01.740
So... what's your type, Iruma-kun?

07:01.740 --> 07:03.410
Wh-Wh-Wh-Why ask me that so suddenly?!

07:03.410 --> 07:05.920
It's not sudden! We were 
just talking about marriage!

07:05.920 --> 07:07.020
What?!

07:07.020 --> 07:09.180
By the way, according to 
my own personal research...

07:09.180 --> 07:12.280
Girls with long tails are super sexy.

07:13.190 --> 07:15.280
I've never heard this!

07:15.280 --> 07:17.230
I know you're interested, Iruma-kun!

07:17.230 --> 07:18.640
No, I'm not...

07:18.640 --> 07:21.920
Yeah, you're lying. Stop acting 
all innocent! I know the truth!

07:21.920 --> 07:22.480
Uh...

07:22.480 --> 07:23.540
All right, then.

07:23.780 --> 07:27.530
I guess I'll just have to 
use my secret weapon.

07:27.530 --> 07:30.190
S-Secret weapon?

07:34.610 --> 07:36.920
A slightly pervy book!

07:36.920 --> 07:38.720
No! You can put that away!

07:38.720 --> 07:40.380
Why?! I'm letting you borrow it!

07:40.380 --> 07:42.960
I'm sure you've at least seen these before!

07:42.960 --> 07:44.080
I have...

07:44.080 --> 07:46.170
But I always just set them on fire.

07:44.990 --> 07:46.690
So warm...

07:46.170 --> 07:47.580
Why would you burn them?!

07:47.580 --> 07:49.470
Go on, take it!

07:49.470 --> 07:51.070
But Grandpa will get mad at me!

07:51.070 --> 07:52.270
What are you, a sheltered girl?

07:52.270 --> 07:54.100
I-I'm not a girl...

07:54.100 --> 07:55.600
Then you're a sheltered Iruma.

07:55.600 --> 07:58.600
You need to crawl out of your shell 
and open the doors to adulthood!

07:57.570 --> 07:59.940
No! I don't!

07:58.600 --> 08:01.080
This is also from my personal research...

08:00.490 --> 08:02.490
No, really!

08:01.080 --> 08:04.080
When girls have huge, round horns...

08:04.080 --> 08:04.530
Wh-What?

08:04.530 --> 08:06.730
See? You <i>are</i> interested!

08:05.600 --> 08:08.370
No, no. I was just kidding. I was kidding!

08:11.960 --> 08:14.720
Quit yer yappin', you dumbass Lead!

08:14.720 --> 08:17.720
I'm still hungover from the devi mixer!

08:17.720 --> 08:19.360
N-Nee-chan!

08:19.360 --> 08:21.220
Sh-She's your sister?

08:21.220 --> 08:23.800
Why are you having so 
much fun when your sister

08:21.220 --> 08:24.340
Ow! Ow! Ow!

08:23.800 --> 08:26.150
didn't manage to get a date again?!

08:26.150 --> 08:28.740
Don't make me literally 
hang you out to dry!

08:27.300 --> 08:29.980
My classmate is here! Stop!

08:29.980 --> 08:31.870
Classmate?

08:31.870 --> 08:33.760
Oh, I'm Iruma.

08:33.760 --> 08:35.170
Thanks for letting me come over.

08:35.170 --> 08:36.240
<i>Bow.</i>

08:38.480 --> 08:40.170
Hang on one sec!

08:43.030 --> 08:44.000
Huh?

08:44.080 --> 08:53.760
<b>Shax Shakky</b>

08:44.320 --> 08:48.270
It's a pleasure to meet you! 
I'm Lead's older sister, Shakky!

08:48.270 --> 08:51.250
My hobby is cooking, and my type 
is someone older who's dependable.

08:51.250 --> 08:52.380
Do you have an older brother?

08:52.380 --> 08:53.760
Stop that!

08:53.760 --> 08:55.170
Get out already!

08:55.170 --> 08:57.490
What? Let me talk to the cute boy!

08:57.490 --> 08:59.640
You talked to him enough!

09:02.720 --> 09:04.400
Sorry about that, Iruma-kun.

09:04.400 --> 09:05.390
It's okay.

09:05.610 --> 09:07.580
You and your sister... look alike.

09:07.580 --> 09:08.520
Don't say that!

09:08.520 --> 09:10.020
Wait a minute!

09:08.610 --> 09:10.020
<b>Wardrobe Change</b>

09:10.020 --> 09:12.030
Iruma is the chair-demon's grandson!

09:12.030 --> 09:15.030
Gah! She came back! 
Go back to your room already!

09:15.510 --> 09:17.110
No way!

09:17.110 --> 09:19.120
Would you like some snacks, Iruma-kun?

09:19.120 --> 09:19.800
Sure!

09:19.800 --> 09:21.410
Don't fall for it, Iruma-kun!

09:21.410 --> 09:23.250
Hey! I'm gonna sit, so move.

09:23.250 --> 09:25.540
Oh, dear! That book...

09:27.460 --> 09:29.540
W-Wait just a second!

09:31.960 --> 09:33.760
No fair leaving me out!

09:33.760 --> 09:35.670
You weren't invited!

09:35.670 --> 09:39.610
Don't go trying to sink your poison fangs 
into Iruma-kun just 'cause he's so spacey.

09:39.610 --> 09:40.890
What poison fangs?!

09:40.890 --> 09:42.630
You're way too protective of him!

09:42.630 --> 09:45.190
Well, that's because Iruma-kun is...

09:45.190 --> 09:47.290
like my little brother.

09:47.290 --> 09:49.090
Lead-kun!

09:49.090 --> 09:51.520
He'd be in all kinds of trouble 
if I didn't look out for him.

09:51.520 --> 09:54.680
Hey, didn't you say something 
like that before, too?

09:54.680 --> 09:58.200
Something about when your
 classmate joined the Game Battler.

09:59.140 --> 10:02.200
<b>Raising Children</b>

09:59.280 --> 10:01.520
I have to watch over Clarin!

10:04.990 --> 10:06.670
You've changed.

10:08.050 --> 10:11.800
Before, you kept to yourself 
and didn't cling to others.

10:12.580 --> 10:14.960
Oh, stop trying to act so cool!

10:14.960 --> 10:18.030
And you keep getting more games 
that are multiplayer!

10:18.800 --> 10:20.640
Well...

10:20.640 --> 10:25.210
You must really love 
your classmates now, huh?

10:29.630 --> 10:31.000
Yeah, actually.

10:34.610 --> 10:37.480
Now stay out of my room!

10:37.480 --> 10:40.820
Here's some water! 
Drink that and go to sleep!

10:43.830 --> 10:45.570
Huh...

10:45.840 --> 10:49.720
And all you'd ever say before 
was how bored you were...

10:54.800 --> 10:56.560
I'm devi exhausted...

10:56.560 --> 10:58.830
Oh, Lead-kun! Take a look at this!

10:58.840 --> 11:00.760
<b>Name</b>

10:58.840 --> 11:00.760
<b>Iruma</b>

10:58.840 --> 11:00.760
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 30 0 30

10:58.840 --> 11:00.760
<b>Gender</b>

10:58.840 --> 11:00.760
<b>Male</b>

10:58.840 --> 11:00.760
<b>Female  Other</b>

10:58.840 --> 11:00.760
<b>First-Person Pronoun (I)</b>

10:58.840 --> 11:00.760
<b>Boku</b>

10:58.840 --> 11:00.760
<b>Ore</b>

10:58.840 --> 11:00.760
<b>Watashi   Other</b>

10:59.570 --> 11:00.760
I made my character.

11:00.760 --> 11:03.060
And you're fully equipped.

11:03.060 --> 11:05.460
Thanks for helping me out, Lead-kun!

11:06.070 --> 11:07.380
You see...

11:08.200 --> 11:10.600
I truly think I only won 
the Harvest Festival

11:10.600 --> 11:14.190
because everyone in our 
class helped me out.

11:14.190 --> 11:19.400
Especially you. You helped me 
out so much when we teamed up.

11:19.400 --> 11:20.760
I'm really grateful.

11:22.280 --> 11:26.630
You're super funny, and you 
teach me all kinds of things.

11:26.960 --> 11:30.240
That's why I think of you...

11:31.480 --> 11:35.510
I think of you as a really reliable...

11:35.510 --> 11:38.400
little brother!

11:40.880 --> 11:44.040
Now, hang on a second! 
You're the little brother here!

11:44.040 --> 11:45.670
No, you're the little brother.

11:45.670 --> 11:46.760
Why, though?!

11:46.770 --> 11:47.760
Little brother.

11:47.760 --> 11:49.720
Why are you suddenly being stubborn?!

11:49.720 --> 11:52.190
Because... you're the little brother.

11:52.190 --> 11:53.640
You're still being stubborn!

11:53.640 --> 11:55.850
Lead, I want some udon!

11:55.850 --> 11:57.770
Oh, for crying out loud!

11:57.770 --> 12:00.080
Lead-kun, you're the little brother.

11:59.400 --> 12:02.030
<b>Little Brother</b>

12:09.600 --> 12:14.270
<b>I will
 protect Babyls</b>

12:15.540 --> 12:20.050
<b>Heartfelt Cooking Class</b>

12:15.810 --> 12:18.440
"Heartfelt Cooking Class."

12:20.550 --> 12:24.110
<i>Sweets! Sweet! Baking!</i>

12:24.440 --> 12:28.280
<i>I'm going to make some delicious
cookies for Kakeru-kun!</i>

12:29.170 --> 12:32.860
<i>You've got this, Rin! Now's the time!</i>

12:32.860 --> 12:34.390
<i>Now's the time...</i>

12:34.390 --> 12:38.620
"...to unleash my right arm that has
struck down countless enemies!"

12:38.620 --> 12:44.250
"I'll work my hips into this Screw Punch
to make some super chewy dough!"

12:44.250 --> 12:46.080
"Hi-yah! Hi-yah!"

12:46.080 --> 12:48.120
"Smack, smack!"

12:48.400 --> 12:52.120
Will she be able to complete
the cookies to give to Kakeru-kun?!

12:52.120 --> 12:53.490
To be continued!

12:58.630 --> 13:01.640
The realism in today's reading was superb!

13:01.640 --> 13:04.130
It's been a long time, so I put my all into it.

13:04.130 --> 13:08.130
<i>Also, my performance back at the ruins 
is still pretty fresh in my mind...</i>

13:08.140 --> 13:09.640
First Love Memories

13:10.510 --> 13:12.560
<i>I'd like to congratulate Iruma,</i>

13:12.830 --> 13:17.190
<i>but the first-years are the stars today, 
so I'll choose another time.</i>

13:17.610 --> 13:18.900
<i>I know...</i>

13:18.900 --> 13:21.600
<i>I'll get him something
 to congratulate him.</i>

13:21.610 --> 13:24.860
First Love Memories

13:21.930 --> 13:24.860
Hmm... Sweets, eh?

13:24.860 --> 13:26.580
That's not a bad idea.

13:27.110 --> 13:27.790
Huh?

13:27.790 --> 13:31.020
Huh?! I mean, I'm interested
in baking sweets,

13:31.020 --> 13:33.740
but I've been told that I'm strictly
prohibited from using our kitchen.

13:33.740 --> 13:36.620
Strictly prohibited? Why is that?

13:36.620 --> 13:40.410
I'm not quite sure.
My father's never told me.

13:40.410 --> 13:43.630
Oh, then, Ameri-san...
would you like to come over?

13:43.630 --> 13:45.270
<i>Would you like to come over?</i>

13:45.270 --> 13:46.510
<i>Would you like to come over?</i>

13:46.510 --> 13:47.630
<i>Would you like to come over?</i>

13:49.090 --> 13:50.240
<i>Hi-yah!</i>

13:50.240 --> 13:51.890
<i>Smack, smack!</i>

13:53.480 --> 13:54.600
And now...

13:54.600 --> 13:56.730
<b>Kitchen</b>

13:55.330 --> 13:56.730
Let's...

13:56.740 --> 13:58.720
do some cooking!

13:58.720 --> 14:01.220
Yeah!

14:01.220 --> 14:03.990
<i>I... I'm actually in Iruma's house!</i>

14:03.990 --> 14:05.680
<i>I-Is this...</i>

14:06.720 --> 14:10.870
<i>P-P-P-P-P-Practice for 
when we get married?!</i>

14:10.870 --> 14:13.200
Thanks for preparing all this, Opera-san!

14:13.200 --> 14:14.200
No problem at all.

14:14.200 --> 14:15.020
Excuse me!

14:15.020 --> 14:17.480
Should I go greet your grandfather, as well?!

14:17.480 --> 14:18.590
Grandfather?

14:18.590 --> 14:22.500
Oh, well, I mean my future—
I mean, the chair-demon!

14:22.500 --> 14:23.530
Oh.

14:23.530 --> 14:27.750
Surprisingly, the chair-demon is away
at work today, so he's not here.

14:27.750 --> 14:29.600
O-Oh, I see.

14:30.320 --> 14:33.000
Well, I'll be over there,

14:33.000 --> 14:35.220
so please go ahead and 
use anything you need.

14:35.220 --> 14:37.140
Okay! Thank you very much!

14:39.640 --> 14:41.900
<i>W-We're all alone!</i>

14:43.780 --> 14:46.140
<i>This is our first time working together!</i>

14:46.140 --> 14:50.240
<i>Actually, I'm not sure if 
it's our first time, but...</i>

14:50.240 --> 14:52.160
Well, why don't we get started?

14:52.160 --> 14:53.980
R-Right!

14:53.980 --> 14:57.690
Er, sorry to have to borrow so much.

14:57.690 --> 15:00.240
Oh, no problem. I'm the
one who invited you over.

15:00.240 --> 15:01.300
And...

15:01.300 --> 15:05.410
This is my first time making sweets,
so I'm happy to be making them with you!

15:06.680 --> 15:08.760
I-I see.

15:08.760 --> 15:10.760
Okay, first up...

15:10.760 --> 15:12.130
Handwashing!

15:16.400 --> 15:17.280
<i>Hmm...</i>

15:17.280 --> 15:19.640
<i>I should probably keep an eye on them.</i>

15:19.640 --> 15:23.680
<i>Well, they have a recipe,
so they should be all right...</i>

15:20.050 --> 15:21.750
Okay, all set!

15:21.750 --> 15:22.640
Right!

15:22.650 --> 15:24.400
<b>Top Secret</b>

15:22.650 --> 15:24.400
<b>Opera's Recipes</b>

15:24.400 --> 15:25.690
Let's see...

15:25.690 --> 15:28.280
According to the recipe from Opera-san...

15:29.360 --> 15:32.350
Heartfelt Cooking Class!

15:35.160 --> 15:38.660
<i>How to make Opera's personal special cookies.</i>

15:35.280 --> 15:42.790
<b>Opera's Personal Special Cookies</b>

15:38.660 --> 15:39.580
They're delicious!

15:39.580 --> 15:41.400
A top secret luxurious taste!

15:41.400 --> 15:42.790
Pekepon!

15:42.790 --> 15:45.920
Step one: Knead 120 grams of butter,

15:42.790 --> 15:49.130
<i>1. Knead 120 grams of butter,
then add 50 grams of sugar and mix well.</i>

15:42.790 --> 15:49.130
m 0 0 l 500 0 500 100 0 100


15:42.790 --> 15:49.130
<i>Sugar</i>

15:42.790 --> 15:49.130
<i>Butter</i>

15:45.920 --> 15:49.000
then add 50 grams of sugar and mix well.

15:49.520 --> 15:51.920
Okay, first, take the butter and...

15:51.920 --> 15:53.120
There!

15:53.120 --> 15:54.300
Now for some sugar.

15:54.300 --> 15:55.670
<i>Iruma-sama!</i>

15:55.670 --> 15:59.570
<i>Why did he put all the butter in?!
The recipe clearly states how many grams!</i>

15:59.570 --> 16:00.760
Hey, Iruma!

16:00.760 --> 16:02.920
<i>Yes, exactly, Ameri-san.</i>

16:02.920 --> 16:04.930
<i>Tell him to look at the actual recipe.</i>

16:04.930 --> 16:06.720
I think we need more sugar.

16:05.020 --> 16:07.820
Sugar

16:06.720 --> 16:07.770
Ah...

16:07.770 --> 16:09.070
<i>Sugar?!</i>

16:07.820 --> 16:09.070
Sugar

16:10.500 --> 16:14.000
I've heard that sweets require
a ridiculous amount of sugar.

16:14.000 --> 16:15.460
How pretty.

16:15.460 --> 16:17.690
<i>Wait, there are limits! Limits!</i>

16:18.460 --> 16:22.700
<i>Could it be that these two have
absolutely no knowledge of cooking?!</i>

16:22.700 --> 16:24.540
What do you think this is?

16:24.540 --> 16:26.670
Who knows? Let's chop it up and put it in.

16:26.670 --> 16:27.600
<i>That's a spatula!</i>

16:27.600 --> 16:30.920
<i>Indeed! Opera's suspicions were correct.</i>

16:31.160 --> 16:34.220
<i>Iruma spent most of his life trying
to survive, so his philosophy</i>

16:31.180 --> 16:34.810
There! Now! It should be ready to eat.

16:34.220 --> 16:37.510
<i>was to throw everything into
a pot, cook it, and eat it.</i>

16:37.510 --> 16:40.390
Do you have any experience
making sweets, Ameri-san?

16:40.390 --> 16:42.280
Yes. I made a cake once.

16:42.280 --> 16:43.640
Oh, you did?

16:43.640 --> 16:46.030
I gave it to my father, but...

16:46.310 --> 16:49.150
Enjoy every bite, Father!

16:49.150 --> 16:51.320
There's plenty more where that came from.

16:54.340 --> 16:56.720
<i>The reason she was prohibited 
from using the kitchen</i>

16:56.720 --> 16:59.700
<i>was because she was
fundamentally a terrible cook.</i>

16:59.700 --> 17:02.320
It was just so delicious that
his heart was literally burning,

17:02.320 --> 17:04.460
so he told me not to
make it again for a while!

17:04.750 --> 17:07.510
<i>Is she actually confident
in her cooking skills?</i>

17:08.110 --> 17:10.920
Okay, next up is the eggs.

17:10.920 --> 17:11.650
Hi-yah!

17:11.650 --> 17:12.880
<i>Why would you throw them in whole?!</i>

17:12.880 --> 17:15.630
<i>He doesn't throw away the shells 
because it would be wasteful.</i>

17:15.630 --> 17:17.510
Now to gently mix the dough!

17:17.510 --> 17:19.260
<i>She cut through the counter?!</i>

17:19.580 --> 17:20.880
What's this powder?

17:20.880 --> 17:22.890
Let's just put it all in.

17:22.890 --> 17:24.180
There's smoke coming out.

17:24.180 --> 17:25.520
Oh, it ran away!

17:25.520 --> 17:27.520
Which one of these is the oven?

17:27.520 --> 17:29.260
Will using Raffire directly work?

17:28.020 --> 17:29.260
U-Um...

17:29.260 --> 17:30.400
Let's do it!

17:38.790 --> 17:39.760
We did it!

17:39.760 --> 17:40.960
No, you didn't.

17:42.310 --> 17:43.630
Listen carefully.

17:43.630 --> 17:47.030
You clearly do not understand
cooking on a fundamental level.

17:47.790 --> 17:49.800
Don't look so confused.

17:50.110 --> 17:51.360
Listen carefully.

17:51.720 --> 17:56.290
Cooking is all about precisely following
the recipe, the correct method,

17:56.290 --> 17:58.280
working carefully...

17:58.280 --> 18:00.640
and heart.

18:00.640 --> 18:02.140
Heart?

18:02.440 --> 18:08.890
Think about the smiles and happy
faces of those who will eat your cooking,

18:08.890 --> 18:11.400
and put your heart into it.

18:13.400 --> 18:14.900
Do you understand?

18:14.900 --> 18:17.170
Y-Yes!

18:19.900 --> 18:20.800
Again...

18:21.080 --> 18:23.920
You need to measure out 
the amount listed in the recipe.

18:23.920 --> 18:25.530
Oh, right.

18:25.530 --> 18:27.800
Wait. You need to measure that properly.

18:27.800 --> 18:28.940
Oh, right.

18:29.250 --> 18:31.040
Is that about right?

18:33.060 --> 18:34.120
Yes.

18:34.120 --> 18:37.680
Quickly and broadly mix in a circle,
following the curve of the bowl.

18:38.800 --> 18:42.000
Hold it. What do you think you're doing?

18:42.380 --> 18:44.180
Stop looking so confused.

18:44.180 --> 18:46.190
No! I can't throw them away!

18:46.190 --> 18:48.880
Iruma-sama, egg shells
are combustible trash.

18:48.880 --> 18:50.820
No!

18:50.820 --> 18:52.600
Strawberries!

18:52.600 --> 18:54.560
H-Hey! Don't run away from me!

18:54.560 --> 18:56.120
Let's capture them.

18:56.110 --> 18:57.630
<b>Seal</b>

18:56.400 --> 18:58.240
I wonder what this is.

18:59.210 --> 19:00.480
I'll just open it.

19:01.360 --> 19:02.220
Huh?

19:03.890 --> 19:04.870
Iruma-sama!

19:11.200 --> 19:12.500
Opera-san!

19:12.760 --> 19:13.920
Begone!

19:17.250 --> 19:18.510
Seal!

19:25.020 --> 19:27.270
There we go.

19:29.150 --> 19:30.270
Wait, why?!

19:30.270 --> 19:33.120
I'm sorry, Opera-san!
We're surrounded!

19:33.120 --> 19:34.200
Wait, <i>why</i>?!

19:42.310 --> 19:44.130
We did it!

19:45.530 --> 19:47.580
Grandpa and Opera-san!

19:47.580 --> 19:49.880
This one's Azz-kun, and this one's Clara!

19:49.880 --> 19:51.610
Yes, well done.

19:51.610 --> 19:53.270
This must be Henri-san.

19:53.270 --> 19:54.540
Yes!

19:54.540 --> 19:56.400
They look really good!

19:56.400 --> 19:57.460
We did it!

19:57.460 --> 19:58.870
You're amazing, Opera-san!

19:58.870 --> 20:00.870
Er, thanks.

20:00.870 --> 20:03.590
I'm going to get some fresh air.

20:03.590 --> 20:06.000
Everything you'll need for
wrapping them is over there.

20:06.000 --> 20:06.980
Right!

20:08.880 --> 20:11.810
Hmm... I don't know what to 
choose. What should I choose?

20:12.290 --> 20:15.280
The people I'm going to give 
these to are the ones

20:15.280 --> 20:18.560
who always help me out, like Grandpa,
Opera-san, Master Bachiko...

20:18.560 --> 20:21.270
Azz-kun, and Clara...

20:22.560 --> 20:26.320
By the way, who are you
giving yours to, Ameri-san?

20:26.320 --> 20:28.320
Er, I...

20:36.650 --> 20:38.560
Ameri-san?

20:41.920 --> 20:42.840
Huh?

20:44.340 --> 20:45.240
Ameri-sa—

20:45.240 --> 20:49.340
Y-You're not supposed to look down
when you're giving these to someone.

20:49.680 --> 20:54.240
I didn't get to properly
congratulate you earlier, so...

20:54.510 --> 20:55.880
Allow me to say...

20:56.480 --> 20:59.860
Congratulations on your victory
at the Harvest Festival, Iruma!

21:10.510 --> 21:11.620
Wow!

21:11.620 --> 21:15.120
These are for me?! 
Oh my goodness! I'm so happy!

21:21.980 --> 21:25.480
<i>And so, they finished their 
cooking without incident...</i>

21:28.220 --> 21:29.550
Instructor!

21:29.550 --> 21:31.730
We'd like to make Hamburg steak next!

21:31.730 --> 21:33.130
Please, no.

21:33.130 --> 21:33.840
Huh?

21:34.560 --> 21:37.440
Ad-demon-dum.

21:34.810 --> 21:37.440
<b>Ad-</b>

21:35.560 --> 21:37.440
<b>demon-</b>

21:36.190 --> 21:37.440
<b>dum</b>

21:37.440 --> 21:39.860
Cookies that Iruma-kun made...

21:39.860 --> 21:41.430
Yeah! If you want—

21:42.130 --> 21:43.080
You're crying?!

21:43.080 --> 21:47.320
Iruma-kun's cookies!

21:47.320 --> 21:50.600
Opera! We must prepare for a party!

21:50.600 --> 21:51.220
Right.

21:51.220 --> 21:54.560
An "Iruma-sama has given me cookies 
and we must celebrate" party, yes?

21:54.560 --> 21:57.340
We really don't need to, okay?!

23:35.010 --> 23:38.180
<b>Su</b>

23:35.760 --> 23:38.180
<b>Ki</b>

23:35.800 --> 23:37.380
Su-ki-ma.

23:36.510 --> 23:38.180
<b>Ma</b>

23:38.010 --> 23:41.590
Tweet, tweet, tweet... 
Tweet, tweet, tweet...

23:41.590 --> 23:45.020
Tweet, tweet, tweet, tweet, 
tweet, tweet, tweet...

23:50.860 --> 23:54.200
To Father

23:51.070 --> 23:54.210
H-Here you go, Father.

24:03.000 --> 24:27.980
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

24:04.600 --> 24:07.390
Cleaning the kitchen after 
that was a lot of work,

24:07.390 --> 24:12.240
but the one cookie Iruma-sama 
gave me made it all worth it.

24:12.240 --> 24:15.230
I wonder how much more 
happiness Iruma-sama is

24:15.230 --> 24:19.220
going to give to me, the 
chair-demon, and his friends.

24:19.880 --> 24:22.100
Next time on <i>Welcome to 
Demon School! Iruma-kun</i>,

24:22.510 --> 24:24.210
"Words for My Friends."

24:24.600 --> 24:27.980
I look forward to serving 
you even more, Iruma-sama.
